    "sections": {
        "description": "DigitalX Agencies is a clean and structured theme designed for agency websites, portfolios, and service-based businesses. It provides a responsive layout, customizable sections, and optimized performance to support modern web design needs. With built-in options for showcasing services, team members, case studies, and client testimonials, DigitalX Agencies helps present business information in a clear and organized way. It also supports SEO-friendly structure, fast loading speed, and mobile optimization, which are important for search visibility and user experience. This theme is suitable for digital agencies, marketing professionals, freelancers, creative studios, consultants, and startups looking to build a professional online presence. Users who need simple customization, flexible layouts, and easy content management will find it practical. It focuses on usability and essential website features rather than complex design elements, making it a reliable choice for business-focused websites."
    },
